«
@@ ============================================================
@@ TORoll — takeoff ground roll, integrated step by step.
@@
@@ Input:  Wt Sw rho — the mass, the wing area and the air density;
@@         CL CD mu — the lift and drag coefficients during the roll
@@         and the rolling friction coefficient;
@@         Thr — the thrust, or a list { T0 TLO } of the thrust at
@@         rest and at liftoff, varying linearly with the airspeed;
@@         VLO HW — the liftoff airspeed and the headwind, negative
@@         for a tailwind.
@@         Values with units are converted; plain numbers are taken
@@         in SI units (kg, m², kg/m³, N, m/s).
@@ Output: the ground speed at liftoff GSLO, the duration tLO and the
@@         ground roll sLO, tagged.
@@ Method: the acceleration is (T − D − mu·(W − L))/m at the airspeed
@@ V = GS + HW; the distance and the time are the integrals of GS/a
@@ and 1/a over the ground speed, by Simpson's rule on 100 steps.
@@ Author & design          : Jean Wilson
@@ Co-authors & programming  : Claude & Claude Code (Anthropic)
@@ ============================================================

  → wt sw rho clr cdr muf thr vlo hw
  «
    wt IF DUP TypeName "unit" == THEN UBASE UVAL END
    sw IF DUP TypeName "unit" == THEN UBASE UVAL END
    rho IF DUP TypeName "unit" == THEN UBASE UVAL END
    thr IF DUP TypeName "list" == THEN LIST→ DROP ELSE DUP END
    IF DUP TypeName "unit" == THEN UBASE UVAL END SWAP
    IF DUP TypeName "unit" == THEN UBASE UVAL END SWAP
    vlo IF DUP TypeName "unit" == THEN UBASE UVAL END
    hw IF DUP TypeName "unit" == THEN UBASE UVAL END
    → mk sa ra t0 t1 vl vw
    «
      IF vl vw ≤ THEN "TORoll: headwind above the liftoff speed" DOERR END
      vl vw - 100 /
      → hh
      «
        0 0
        0 100 FOR ii
          ii hh *
          → vg
          «
            vg vw +
            → va
            «
              ra sa * va SQ * 2 /
              → qs
              «
                t0 t1 t0 - va * vl / +
                qs cdr * -
                muf mk 9.80665 * qs clr * - * -
                mk /
              »
            »
            → acc
            «
              IF acc 0 ≤ THEN
                "TORoll: the thrust cannot reach the liftoff speed" DOERR
              END
              IF ii 0 == ii 100 == OR THEN 1
              ELSE IF ii 2 MOD THEN 4 ELSE 2 END END
              → wf
              «
                wf vg * acc /  wf acc /
              »
            »
          »
          ROT + ROT ROT + SWAP
        NEXT
        hh 3 / * SWAP hh 3 / * SWAP
        → sd td
        «
          vl vw - 1_m/s * 1_knot CONVERT "GSLO" →TAG
          td 1_s * "tLO" →TAG
          sd 1_m * 1_ft CONVERT "sLO" →TAG
        »
      »
    »
  »
»
